  "text": " \n\tJohn Doe was arrested and charged with burglary for allegedly breaking into a convenience store at night when the store was closed.\n\tHe used a stone to smash a side window. \n\tThe victim who inherited the store from his parents reported that several thousand dollars were taken from the cash register. \n\tHe described the break-in as \"devastating,\" not just financially but emotionally, as the store is both his livelihood and a cornerstone of the neighborhood. \n\tDoe’s annual income is $15,000.",
